db/ref 1083 #uuid "6fc398c3-ef25-52ba-8a15-a914c2acb08b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434379 #edb/ref 1080 "I and II only" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434379 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434379 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "739f06d6-c702-56c9-a051-08e032332d7a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434380 #edb/ref 1080 "III only" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434380 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434380 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "9ab8acb2-0f16-5f40-8fd6-1f3209f135e3" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434381 #edb/ref 1080 "I only" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434381 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434381 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "c956c11a-2fd4-59e8-a085-706468c3a376" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434382 #edb/ref 1080 "greater than" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434382 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434382 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "cb6ea343-a5aa-5d69-b351-d0c27cab6e7f" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434383 #edb/ref 1080 "smaller than" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434383 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434383 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "f52cda3d-118c-5960-b7d2-b5e6e6485224" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434384 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186434372 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434384 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186434377 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434384 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186434379 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434384 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186434380 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434384 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186434381 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434384 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434384 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434384 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186434381 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434384 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "09954eee-e3cc-5394-bd09-4440f9d978a2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434385 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186434378 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434385 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186434382 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434385 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186434383 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434385 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045494 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434385 #edb/ref 1077 "field-2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434385 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186434382 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434385 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "0b435f79-e45f-54bc-a9c1-2ebc68f39df2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434386 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186434373 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434386 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186434374 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434386 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186434375 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434386 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186434376 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434386 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045494 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434386 #edb/ref 1077 "field-1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434386 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186434375 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434386 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "c1896846-f13a-5c11-a37a-ffc9a894ca42" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434387 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186434385 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434387 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186434386 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434387 #edb/ref 1069 "q-349678" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434387 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434387 #edb/ref 1071 "Select the options that make the statement below true.\n\n$\\,$\n$45%$ is equivalent to \n{{field-1}},\nwhich is \n{{field-2}}\n$\\frac{17}{40}.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434387 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "138791bc-5cad-58ca-ae3d-64015f9ea134" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434387 #edb/ref 1074 "To convert the percent to a fraction, we first write $45%$ as a fraction with a denominator $100:$\n\n$$\n45%=\\frac{45}{100}\n$$\n\nWe can simplify the fraction by dividing the numerator and denominator by $5:$\n\n$$\n\\frac{45}{100}=\\frac{45÷5}{100÷5}=\\frac{9}{20}\n$$\n\nWe can write this with a denominator of $40$ by multiplying the numerator and denominator by $2:$\n\n$$\n\\frac{9}{20}=\\frac{9\\times 2}{20\\times 2}=\\frac{18}{40}\n$$\n\nNow, notice that\n\n$$\n\\frac{18}{40}>\\frac{17}{40}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, $45%$ is equivalent to $\\frac{18}{40},$ \nwhich is $\\text{greater than}$ $\\frac{17}{40}.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434388 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186434384 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434388 #edb/ref 1069 "q-350266" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434388 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434388 #edb/ref 1071 "Sana and Talia are students. In the previous semester, the decimal proportion of Sana’s homework assignments that were turned in early was $0.4,$ while $45%$ of Talia’s homework assignments were turned in early. \n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nI. Less than half of Sana's homework assignments were turned in early.\n\nII. More than half of Talia's homework assignments were turned in early.\n\nIII. Sana had a greater percentage of homework assignments turned in early compared to Talia." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434388 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "16a4ed86-6ba4-5b08-b5bc-00c64da3da49" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434388 #edb/ref 1074 "Let's examine our statements in turn.\n\n- Statement I is true. Indeed, since \n\n$$\n0.4<0.5,\n$$\n\nless than half of Sana's homework assignments were turned in early.\n\n- Statement II is false. Notice that \n\n$$\n45%<50%.\n$$\n\nSo, less than half of Talia's homework assignments were turned in early.\n\n- Statement III is false. We can compare $0.4$ and $45%$ by converting the decimal into a percent. \n\nTo do this, we multiply it by $100:$\n\n$$\n0.4\\times 100=40%\n$$\n\nSince  $40%<45%,$ Sana did not have a greater percentage of homework assignments turned in early compared to Talia.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only\"." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434389 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186434392 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434389 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "334dd9af-1647-5c57-bfb3-97a4e3ad59e7" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434389 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186147797 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434390 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186434391 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434390 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "37767ed4-b4c6-547e-a639-f6aeaee3ddec" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434390 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186147801 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434391 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186434393 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434391 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "63533d39-a10e-52e0-8ad1-5274656cd410" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434391 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186434387 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434392 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186434390 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434392 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "cf9b1dbf-2308-5acb-ba12-635c8825ef8b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434392 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186147799 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434393 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "e00df753-1591-526d-a3e8-f3c5207c5bfd" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186434393 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186434388 #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
